# WSL/Windows "mark of the web" artifacts that appear next to downloaded files
*:Zone.Identifier

# Agent skills are materialized per machine (like node_modules); the shareable
# artifact is skills-lock.json, which stays tracked. Run `bunx skills add
# elysiajs/skills` to restore them.
.claude

# Personal AI-workflow files at the repo root only (leading slash = root). The
# SDLC framework references the gitignored .claude/ agents, so it stays local,
# not shared. Per-app apps/*/AGENTS.md are project files and remain tracked.
#
# `docs` used to sit here, and being slashless it matched at every depth: it hid
# the root docs/ *and* apps/*/docs/. Those are the durable requirement record
# that replaced the frozen OpenSpec archive — the one thing a change is supposed
# to keep up to date — so they belong in the repository, not on one machine.
/AGENTS.md
/CLAUDE.md
/CONTEXT.md

# Uploaded sound files (SOUND_DIR). Runtime data, not source.
apps/api/storage/
